# No production credentials or default administrator are supplied.
# Public, exact origin is configured in wrangler.jsonc before deployment.
# Do not place CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN, D1 credentials, or passwords in this file.
# Bootstrap credentials must be supplied transiently in your operator terminal.
# Optional local read-only production preview URL:
# CAMPUSDROP_PREVIEW_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:4173

# CloudBase same-origin website origin; only needed when deploying its API bridge.
# CAMPUSDROP_CLOUDBASE_ORIGIN=https://your-actual-hosting-domain
# Never put Tencent secrets or passwords in VITE_* values.
